NOTE ON DATA vs CODE

The above MIT license covers the SOFTWARE (the code in this repository).

The catalog DATA — `src/open_audio_fetch/catalog.json` and the generated
`SITES.md` — is dedicated to the public domain under Creative Commons CC0 1.0
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/), so anyone may reuse the
index freely. See LICENSE-DATA.

Neither license applies to the third-party AUDIO this tool downloads: that
content keeps whatever license its source assigns it (recorded per item in the
catalog and in each download's manifest). Downloading is subject to each
source's terms; redistribution depends on each item's license.
